    },
    {
      "text": "Bring a large pot of lightly salted water to a boil. Cook spaghetti in the boiling water, stirring occasionally, until tender yet firm to the bite, about 12 minutes. Rinse in cool water, drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gnSdjpAmHKYbU686V5YCTVzgxZI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11922-spaghetti-salad-iii-VAT-004-step-02-64dcbeb1583641cda9dba699df7652e8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11922/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place chopped tomatoes, green bell pepper, onion, and cucumber in a large bowl; add Cheddar cheese and salad seasoning.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/57XgvlkVAdyWqxb7GyMtnnHPAxU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/11922-spaghetti-salad-iii-VAT-005-step-03-2ed5551241d941ab9c64199c5b1b87e9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11922/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add cooled pasta to large bowl with vegetables and pour salad dressing over top. Toss well to coat. For best flavor, chill for several hours before serving.",
